---
description: >-
  Sets flowchart.htmlLabels to false in config to force SVG (non-HTML) edge
  label rendering, then renders a CUSTOMER/ORDER/LINE-ITEM/ADDRESS/INVOICE
  schema with both single-word and quoted multi-word relationship labels,
  verifying labels stay legible without HTML label support.
config:
  logLevel: 1
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
---
erDiagram
  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places
  ORDER ||--|{ LINE-ITEM : contains
  CUSTOMER ||--|{ ADDRESS : "invoiced at"
  CUSTOMER ||--|{ ADDRESS : "receives goods at"
  ORDER ||--o{ INVOICE : "liable for"
